{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzUePcSkegYAT9AoR1Q7rZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Workers no_nodejs_compat compatibility flag default enabled compatibility date\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Compatibility flags · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/compatibility-flags/\"},{\"title\":\"Node.js compatibility · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers Best Practices · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/best-practices/workers-best-practices/\"},{\"title\":\"http · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/http/\"},{\"title\":\"Node.js compatibility is now enabled by default · Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-04-nodejs-compat-default/\"},{\"title\":\"https · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/https/\"},{\"title\":\"fs · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/fs/\"},{\"title\":\"Configuration explorer · Cloudflare CLI docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/cf/projects/config-explorer/\"},{\"title\":\"OpenNext adapter · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/framework-guides/web-apps/opennext/\"},{\"title\":\"New Best Practices guide for Workers · Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-02-15-workers-best-practices/\"}]\n\nPer Cloudflare's docs and changelog, `nodejs_compat` is now on by default for newer compatibility dates, and `no_nodejs_compat` is the way to turn it off.\n\n- **Default for new dates:** Cloudflare's August 4, 2026 changelog says Workers with a compatibility date of 2026-08-04 or later get Node.js compatibility automatically, Workers with a compatibility date of 2026-08-04 or later enable Node.js compatibility by default.\n- **Opting out:** The compatibility flags page describes the switch-off: for dates from 2026-08-04 onward, you remove the positive flags if present and add both no_nodejs_compat and no_nodejs_compat_v2.\n- **Older dates:** Workers on earlier dates still need to opt in, and the docs say that for compatibility dates before 2026-08-04, add the nodejs_compat compatibility flag to your Wrangler configuration file.\n- **Existing projects:** Updating an existing project's date doesn't require removing the flags. The docs note that existing projects do not need to remove them when updating their compatibility date.\n\nThe results don't say whether `nodejs_compat_v2` has its own separate default, and the changelog and docs both describe the 2026-08-04 change as recent, so check the current docs before relying on the exact cutoff.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3d22e95-a860-483c-becb-a38577155f35","uuid":"c0b0317f-d947-4086-ad9d-862dcb37ff6b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:42:42.300Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers no_nodejs_compat compatibility flag default enabled compatibility date","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MsmYNu9nXNKyVrjGpC9eFc","content":[{"title":"Compatibility flags · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/compatibility-flags/"},{"title":"Node.js compatibility · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/"},{"title":"Workers Best Practices · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/best-practices/workers-best-practices/"},{"title":"http · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/http/"},{"title":"Node.js 